{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-meet-science2-10","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"chemistry","number":10,"points":null,"unitId":"gas","unitLabel":"기체","topic":"이상기체·기체의부피","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gas","thermo","phase"],"stem":"그림은1 몰의액체사염화탄소(CCl4)가정상끓는점(76.8℃)에서\n완전히기화되는계의상태변화를나타낸것이다.\n<계의상태가변할때의조건과자료>\n․온도와압력은일정하게유지된다.\n․기체는이상기체법칙을따른다.\n․사염화탄소의기화열(ΔH기화)은29.8 kJ/mol이다.\n․기화과정에서계가주위에한일은2.9 kJ이다.\n이계의상태변화에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 계의엔트로피는증가한다.\nㄴ. 기화된기체의부피는22.4 L이다.\nㄷ. 계는주위로부터32.7 kJ의에너지를흡수한다.\nㄹ. 사염화탄소의내부에너지는26.9 kJ 증가한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":765,"height":579,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,46.867,306.0,231.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-meet-science2-10/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":765,"height":212,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,337.667,306.0,84.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-meet-science2-10/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[82.744,519.533,416.5,990.382],"width":333.756,"height":470.849,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.456,46.867,306.0,231.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,337.667,306.0,84.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"10. 그림은1 몰의액체사염화탄소(CCl4)가정상끓는점(76.8℃)에서","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318